      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/missingno/{size}/2049_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-01-29T23:28:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>After the mess that was last game's one-shot, I'll take an easy mint.&nbsp; My forced deployment strat was simply to have Parse use Between the Lines on Sky Sky, who was not only big but also had proportionist out so she could anihilate all the minions with a single clap.&nbsp; I feel I could have finished faster if I put out the cyclone faster.</p>",
