      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/51bf81/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-01-31T07:59:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For kicks and giggles, I played through with the heroes never directly attacking Voss (though Compulsion Canister and Wounding Buffer did result in some damage to him). &nbsp;I just controlled his army and healed up, and let the civilians do the dirty work (there’s probably a political allegory in that somewhere). &nbsp;Finished with everybody (including constructs and civilians) at full HP.</p>",
